timeline TD
    title Paper Chase v1.0 — Ingestion Pipeline at a Glance
    section [USER] Triggers
        Drop PDFs : Drop PDFs into wiki/raw/
        Start : Press "Ingest PDFs" in TUI/CLI
    section [CODE] + [LLM] Per-PDF loop
        Chunk : [CODE] Split PDF into page chunks (a page is never split across chunks)
        Extract : [LLM] Extractor reads chunk + AGENTS.md + rolling memory; emits entities, relationships, claims, tables
        Materialize : [CODE] Aggregate evidence, detect generic labels, curate identities, write candidate pages
        Synthesize/Amend : [LLM] Write a full page OR patch an existing page with structured amendments
        Checkpoint : [CODE] Save PDF state; next PDF
    section [CODE] + [LLM] Finalize
        Validate : [CODE] Check links, citations, frontmatter, preservation
        DOX : [LLM] Write folder + root index.md navigation contracts
        Workspace : [LLM] Add this wiki's segment to the workspace index
        Cross-Wiki : [LLM] Build entity registry, relationship graph, topic clusters (only when 2+ wikis exist)
        Updater : [LLM] Propose AGENTS.md constitution updates (optional)
        Persist : [CODE] Write metrics and final state files
